<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Swa Saw Ke</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1330">1330</a>–<a href="/years/1400">1400</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/14th-century">14th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Swa Saw Ke was king of Ava in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/upper-burma">Upper Burma</a> from 1367 to 1400, consolidating the kingdom founded by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thado-minbya">Thado Minbya</a> in 1365. He brought much of central <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/burma">Burma</a> under Ava's control and in 1385 began the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/forty-years-war">Forty Years' War</a> against the Mon kingdom of Hanthawaddy under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/razadarit">Razadarit</a>, which his son <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/minkhaung-i">Minkhaung I</a> continued. His long reign laid the foundations of Ava as the leading power of Upper Burma.</p></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote><b>Swa Saw Ke</b> became king of Ava, the kingdom founded by Thado Minbya in 1365, and restored central authority in Upper Burma for the first time since the fall of Pagan.</blockquote><a href="/today-in-history/september-5">5 September in history</a></li><li><blockquote><b>Swa Saw Ke</b> and his son Minkhaung I fought the Forty Years' War against Razadarit of the Hanthawaddy Kingdom from 1385 to 1424.</blockquote><a href="/state/ava-kingdom">Ava Kingdom</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Thayet, in what is now <a href="/countries/myanmar">Myanmar</a>. Died in Inwa, in what is now <a href="/countries/myanmar">Myanmar</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=19.32,95.18&amp;year=1375" aria-label="Thayet on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="7123 1448 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Swa Saw Ke"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M7573 1718h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M7573 1718h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=19.32,95.18&amp;year=1375">What was here in 1375? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
